{"seq":3,"slug":"security-auditing","title":"智能合约安全审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/fintech-fundamentals/smart-contracts/security-auditing","wordCount":879,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"智能合约安全审计\">智能合约安全审计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>智能合约安全审计是区块链开发中最关键的质量保障环节。与传统软件不同，智能合约的漏洞一旦被利用往往造成不可逆的资金损失——2016 年 The DAO 事件损失 6000 万美元，2022 年 Wormhole 桥被攻击损失 3.2 亿美元，2023 年 Euler Finance 被闪电贷攻击损失 1.97 亿美元。</p>\n<p>合约安全的核心挑战在于：代码部署后不可修改、所有交易公开可见（攻击者可以分析和模拟）、合约间的组合调用引入意外的交互风险。系统化的安全审计包括人工代码审查、自动化工具扫描和形式化验证三个层次。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[安全审计流程] --&gt; B[自动化扫描]&#10;    A --&gt; C[人工审查]&#10;    A --&gt; D[形式化验证]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[Slither 静态分析]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[Mythril 符号执行]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[Echidna 模糊测试]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[业务逻辑审查]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[权限模型验证]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[经济模型分析]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[数学证明]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[模型检验]\">graph TD\n    A[安全审计流程] --&gt; B[自动化扫描]\n    A --&gt; C[人工审查]\n    A --&gt; D[形式化验证]\n    B --&gt; B1[Slither 静态分析]\n    B --&gt; B2[Mythril 符号执行]\n    B --&gt; B3[Echidna 模糊测试]\n    C --&gt; C1[业务逻辑审查]\n    C --&gt; C2[权限模型验证]\n    C --&gt; C3[经济模型分析]\n    D --&gt; D1[数学证明]\n    D --&gt; D2[模型检验]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>漏洞类型</th>\n<th>风险等级</th>\n<th>历史损失</th>\n<th>防御手段</th>\n<th>检测工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重入攻击</td>\n<td>严重</td>\n<td>The DAO 6000万$</td>\n<td>ReentrancyGuard</td>\n<td>Slither、Mythril</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>闪电贷攻击</td>\n<td>严重</td>\n<td>Euler 1.97亿$</td>\n<td>预言机防护</td>\n<td>经济模型分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整数溢出</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>BEC Token</td>\n<td>Solidity 0.8+</td>\n<td>编译器内置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>访问控制缺陷</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>Parity 1.5亿$</td>\n<td>OpenZeppelin RBAC</td>\n<td>Slither</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格操纵</td>\n<td>严重</td>\n<td>多个协议</td>\n<td>TWAP 预言机</td>\n<td>人工审查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前端运行</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>持续发生</td>\n<td>Commit-Reveal</td>\n<td>MEV 分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"重入攻击与防御\">重入攻击与防御</h2><p>重入攻击（Reentrancy Attack）是智能合约历史上最经典的漏洞。当合约在更新状态之前向外部地址发送 ETH 或调用外部合约时，攻击者可以在回调中重新进入原函数，重复执行提款操作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT&#10;pragma solidity ^0.8.20;&#10;&#10;contract VulnerableVault {&#10;    mapping(address =&gt; uint256) public balances;&#10;&#10;    function deposit() external payable {&#10;        balances[msg.sender] += msg.value;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function withdraw() external {&#10;        uint256 amount = balances[msg.sender];&#10;        require(amount &gt; 0, &quot;No balance&quot;);&#10;&#10;        (bool success, ) = msg.sender.call{value: amount}(&quot;&quot;);&#10;        require(success, &quot;Transfer failed&quot;);&#10;&#10;        balances[msg.sender] = 0;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;contract ReentrancyAttacker {&#10;    VulnerableVault private immutable vault;&#10;&#10;    constructor(address _vault) {&#10;        vault = VulnerableVault(_vault);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function attack() external payable {&#10;        vault.deposit{value: msg.value}();&#10;        vault.withdraw();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    receive() external payable {&#10;        if (address(vault).balance &gt;= vault.balances(address(this))) {&#10;            vault.withdraw();&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pragma solidity ^0.8.20;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract VulnerableVault {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapping(address => uint256) public balances;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function deposit() external payable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        balances[msg.sender] += msg.value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function withdraw() external {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 amount = balances[msg.sender];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(amount > 0, \"No balance\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (bool success, ) = msg.sender.call{value: amount}(\"\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(success, \"Transfer failed\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        balances[msg.sender] = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract ReentrancyAttacker {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    VulnerableVault private immutable vault;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    constructor(address _vault) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vault = VulnerableVault(_vault);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function attack() external payable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vault.deposit{value: msg.value}();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vault.withdraw();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    receive() external payable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (address(vault).balance >= vault.balances(address(this))) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            vault.withdraw();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>防御重入攻击的三道防线：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT&#10;pragma solidity ^0.8.20;&#10;&#10;contract SecureVault {&#10;    mapping(address =&gt; uint256) public balances;&#10;    uint256 private _locked = 1;&#10;&#10;    modifier nonReentrant() {&#10;        require(_locked == 1, &quot;Reentrant call&quot;);&#10;        _locked = 2;&#10;        _;&#10;        _locked = 1;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function deposit() external payable {&#10;        balances[msg.sender] += msg.value;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function withdraw() external nonReentrant {&#10;        uint256 amount = balances[msg.sender];&#10;        require(amount &gt; 0, &quot;No balance&quot;);&#10;&#10;        balances[msg.sender] = 0;&#10;&#10;        (bool success, ) = msg.sender.call{value: amount}(&quot;&quot;);&#10;        require(success, &quot;Transfer failed&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pragma solidity ^0.8.20;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract SecureVault {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapping(address => uint256) public balances;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 private _locked = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modifier nonReentrant() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(_locked == 1, \"Reentrant call\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _locked = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _locked = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function deposit() external payable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        balances[msg.sender] += msg.value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function withdraw() external nonReentrant {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 amount = balances[msg.sender];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(amount > 0, \"No balance\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        balances[msg.sender] = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (bool success, ) = msg.sender.call{value: amount}(\"\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(success, \"Transfer failed\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Checks-Effects-Interactions（CEI）</strong> 模式是最基本的防御原则：先检查条件（Checks），再更新状态（Effects），最后进行外部调用（Interactions）。结合 ReentrancyGuard 可以实现双重防护。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[函数调用] --&gt; B[Checks 检查条件]&#10;    B --&gt;|通过| C[Effects 更新状态]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Interactions 外部调用]&#10;    B --&gt;|失败| E[revert]&#10;    D --&gt;|回调| F{重入检测}&#10;    F --&gt;|已锁定| G[revert]&#10;    F --&gt;|未锁定| A\">graph TD\n    A[函数调用] --&gt; B[Checks 检查条件]\n    B --&gt;|通过| C[Effects 更新状态]\n    C --&gt; D[Interactions 外部调用]\n    B --&gt;|失败| E[revert]\n    D --&gt;|回调| F{重入检测}\n    F --&gt;|已锁定| G[revert]\n    F --&gt;|未锁定| A</pre><h2 id=\"常见攻击向量分析\">常见攻击向量分析</h2><p>除重入攻击外，智能合约还面临多种攻击向量，需要针对性地防御。</p>\n<p><strong>闪电贷攻击</strong> 利用单笔交易内的无抵押借款来操纵价格或利用协议漏洞。攻击者在一笔交易中借入大量资产、操纵价格、获利后归还借款。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface FlashLoanFlow {&#10;  step1: &#39;从 Aave/dYdX 借入大量代币&#39;;&#10;  step2: &#39;在目标 DEX 大量买入/卖出操纵价格&#39;;&#10;  step3: &#39;利用被操纵的价格在目标协议中获利&#39;;&#10;  step4: &#39;归还闪电贷 + 手续费&#39;;&#10;  result: &#39;净利润 = 获利 - 借款手续费 - Gas费&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const analyzeFlashLoanRisk = (protocol: {&#10;  priceSource: &#39;spot&#39; | &#39;twap&#39; | &#39;chainlink&#39;;&#10;  oracleDelay: number;&#10;  liquidityDepth: bigint;&#10;}): &#39;low&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; | &#39;high&#39; =&gt; {&#10;  if (protocol.priceSource === &#39;spot&#39;) return &#39;high&#39;;&#10;  if (protocol.priceSource === &#39;twap&#39; &amp;&amp; protocol.oracleDelay &lt; 30) return &#39;medium&#39;;&#10;  return &#39;low&#39;;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FlashLoanFlow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  step1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '从 Aave/dYdX 借入大量代币'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  step2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '在目标 DEX 大量买入/卖出操纵价格'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  step3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '利用被操纵的价格在目标协议中获利'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  step4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '归还闪电贷 + 手续费'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '净利润 = 获利 - 借款手续费 - Gas费'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> analyzeFlashLoanRisk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  priceSource</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'spot'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'twap'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'chainlink'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  oracleDelay</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  liquidityDepth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'low'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (protocol.priceSource </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'spot'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (protocol.priceSource </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'twap'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> protocol.oracleDelay </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'low'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>前端运行（Front-running）</strong> 是指攻击者观察到交易池中的待处理交易后，通过支付更高 Gas 费用使自己的交易先被执行。在 DEX 交易中尤为常见。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>攻击类型</th>\n<th>攻击原理</th>\n<th>典型目标</th>\n<th>防御方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>三明治攻击</td>\n<td>在目标交易前后各插入一笔交易</td>\n<td>DEX 交易</td>\n<td>滑点保护、私有交易池</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抢先交易</td>\n<td>复制目标交易并提高 Gas</td>\n<td>NFT 铸造、套利</td>\n<td>Commit-Reveal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾随攻击</td>\n<td>在目标交易后立即执行</td>\n<td>清算、套利</td>\n<td>时间锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预言机操纵</td>\n<td>操纵价格源数据</td>\n<td>借贷协议</td>\n<td>TWAP + 多源预言机</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自动化审计工具链\">自动化审计工具链</h2><p>现代合约审计依赖一套完整的自动化工具链，覆盖静态分析、动态测试和形式化验证。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface AuditToolchain {&#10;  staticAnalysis: {&#10;    slither: &#39;检测已知漏洞模式、数据流分析&#39;;&#10;    solhint: &#39;代码风格和最佳实践检查&#39;;&#10;    semgrep: &#39;自定义安全规则匹配&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  dynamicTesting: {&#10;    foundry: &#39;Solidity 原生测试框架&#39;;&#10;    echidna: &#39;基于属性的模糊测试&#39;;&#10;    medusa: &#39;并行模糊测试&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  formalVerification: {&#10;    certora: &#39;SMT 求解器驱动的形式化验证&#39;;&#10;    halmos: &#39;符号执行&#39;;&#10;    act: &#39;行为规约语言&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;const runSecurityPipeline = async (contractPath: string): Promise&lt;AuditReport&gt; =&gt; {&#10;  const staticResults = await runSlither(contractPath);&#10;  const fuzzResults = await runEchidna(contractPath, {&#10;    testLimit: 50000,&#10;    seqLen: 100,&#10;  });&#10;  const symbolicResults = await runMythril(contractPath, {&#10;    executionTimeout: 300,&#10;    maxDepth: 50,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    vulnerabilities: [...staticResults.findings, ...symbolicResults.findings],&#10;    fuzzCoverage: fuzzResults.coverage,&#10;    overallRisk: calculateRiskScore(staticResults, fuzzResults, symbolicResults),&#10;  };&#10;};&#10;&#10;interface AuditReport {&#10;  vulnerabilities: Finding[];&#10;  fuzzCoverage: number;&#10;  overallRisk: &#39;low&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; | &#39;high&#39; | &#39;critical&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Finding {&#10;  severity: &#39;info&#39; | &#39;low&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; | &#39;high&#39; | &#39;critical&#39;;&#10;  title: string;&#10;  description: string;&#10;  location: string;&#10;  recommendation: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const runSlither = async (_path: string): Promise&lt;{ findings: Finding[] }&gt; =&gt; {&#10;  return { findings: [] };&#10;};&#10;&#10;const runEchidna = async (&#10;  _path: string,&#10;  _config: { testLimit: number; seqLen: number },&#10;): Promise&lt;{ coverage: number }&gt; =&gt; {&#10;  return { coverage: 0 };&#10;};&#10;&#10;const runMythril = async (&#10;  _path: string,&#10;  _config: { executionTimeout: number; maxDepth: number },&#10;): Promise&lt;{ findings: Finding[] }&gt; =&gt; {&#10;  return { findings: [] };&#10;};&#10;&#10;const calculateRiskScore = (&#10;  _static: { findings: Finding[] },&#10;  _fuzz: { coverage: number },&#10;  _symbolic: { findings: Finding[] },&#10;): &#39;low&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; | &#39;high&#39; | &#39;critical&#39; =&gt; {&#10;  return &#39;low&#39;;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AuditToolchain</span><span s